# Single source of truth for every pinned version used by this repository.
#
# Consumers:
#   - scripts/install-tools.sh  (downloads the validation binaries)
#   - scripts/validate.sh       (kubeconform -kubernetes-version)
#   - .github/workflows/ci.yml  (kind node image, cluster tooling)
#   - docs/versions.md          (generated from this file)
#
# The weekly maintenance workflow refreshes this file, regenerates docs/versions.md
# and re-runs the full validation before committing anything.

